MD simulation of a spring-mass chain surrounded by fluid particles, with periodic boundaries or confining box.

```gnuplot
gnuplot> p 'out.dat' u 1:5 w l lw 2 t 'no kbox', 'out_PBC.dat' u 1:5 w l lw 2 t 'kbox = 5.0'
gnuplot> set title 'Box confinement'
gnuplot> set xlabel 't [ps]'
gnuplot> set ylabel 'chain lenght [A]'
```